#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:342
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_MossdeepIdealForRockets"
msgid ""
"MOSSDEEP has mainly sunny weather,\n"
"and its winds are stable.\p"
"It's an ideal location for launching\n"
"rockets.$"
msgstr ""
"绿岭市大多是晴天，\n"
"风也很稳定。\p"
"是发射火箭的理想地点。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:348
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_WhyWouldMagmaStealRocketFuel"
msgid ""
"Why would TEAM MAGMA want to steal\n"
"our rocket fuel in the first place?$"
msgstr ""
"熔岩队到底为什么\n"
"要偷我们的火箭燃料呢？$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:352
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_WouldveLikedToBeAstronaut"
msgid ""
"If only I was a little younger, I would\n"
"have liked being an astronaut…\p"
"No… It's not too late!\n"
"I can and will try!$"
msgstr ""
"要是我再年轻一点，\n"
"真想当一名宇航员……\p"
"不……现在还不算晚！\n"
"我能做到，我也一定会去尝试！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:358
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_MagmaCantGetAwayWithThis"
msgid ""
"If TEAM MAGMA takes the rocket fuel,\n"
"I won't be able to go to space!\p"
"They can't be allowed to get away\n"
"with such an outrage!$"
msgstr ""
"要是熔岩队把火箭燃料拿走，\n"
"我就去不了宇宙了！\p"
"绝不能让他们\n"
"做出这种无法无天的事！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:364
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_WishOrdinaryPeopleCouldGoIntoSpace"
msgid ""
"I wish ordinary people could go into\n"
"space one day…$"
msgstr ""
"真希望有一天，\n"
"普通人也能去宇宙……$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:368
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_DoesMagmaWantToGoToSpace"
msgid ""
"TEAM MAGMA…\n"
"Do they want to go to space, too?$"
msgstr ""
"熔岩队……\n"
"他们也想去宇宙吗？$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:372
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_YoureOutnumberedTakeUsOn"
msgid ""
"What's wrong with you?\p"
"You're outnumbered three to one,\n"
"but you still want to take us on?$"
msgstr ""
"你是怎么回事？\p"
"我们是三对一，\n"
"你还想和我们打吗？$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:377
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_GoodAnswer"
msgid ""
"Good answer!\n"
"That's what a smart person'll do!$"
msgstr ""
"回答得好！\n"
"聪明人就该这么做！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:381
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_Grunt5Intro"
msgid ""
"A reckless go-getter, are you?\n"
"Okay, I'll go first!$"
msgstr ""
"你是个不要命的家伙吗？\n"
"好吧，我先上！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:385
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_Grunt5Defeat"
msgid ""
"I lost!\n"
"But!$"
msgstr ""
"我输了！\n"
"但是！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:389
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_Grunt6Intro"
msgid ""
"It's too soon to be relieved!\n"
"I'm up next!$"
msgstr ""
"现在松口气还太早了！\n"
"下一个是我！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:393
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_Grunt6Defeat"
msgid ""
"I lost, too!\n"
"But!$"
msgstr ""
"我也输了！\n"
"但是！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:397
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_Grunt7Intro"
msgid ""
"I bet you want to take a break.\n"
"But I'm not about to let you do that!$"
msgstr ""
"你一定想休息一下吧。\n"
"不过我可不会让你休息！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:401
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_Grunt7Defeat"
msgid ""
"We should've taken a break…\n"
"That's what we should've done…$"
msgstr ""
"我们应该休息一下的……\n"
"早该那么做的……$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:405
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_Grunt6PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Three of us here, and look at the sorry\n"
"mess we got ourselves into.$"
msgstr ""
"我们三个人在这里，\n"
"却落得这么狼狈的下场。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:409
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_Grunt7PostBattle"
msgid ""
"We three losing like this…\n"
"We look worse than usual by triple!$"
msgstr ""
"我们三个人就这样输了……\n"
"比平时还要丢人三倍！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:413
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_Grunt5PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Are we being useful to our leader\n"
"at all?$"
msgstr ""
"我们对首领\n"
"到底有没有一点用处啊？$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:417
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_WellTakeCareOfYou"
msgid ""
"Hehehe!\p"
"We come all the way here to get some\n"
"fuel, and we're interfered with again!\p"
"If you're going to mess with us too,\n"
"we'll take care of you at the same time!$"
msgstr ""
"嘿嘿嘿！\p"
"我们大老远跑来拿燃料，\n"
"又被人妨碍了！\p"
"如果你也要来捣乱，\n"
"我们就连你一起收拾了！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:424
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_MaxieDontInterfere"
msgid ""
"MAXIE: Clear out of the way!\n"
"Don't you dare interfere!$"
msgstr ""
"赤焰松：让开！\n"
"别想来碍事！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:428
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_StevenWhyStealRocketFuel"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: TEAM MAGMA…\p"
"What's the point of stealing rocket\n"
"fuel?$"
msgstr ""
"大吾：熔岩队……\p"
"你们偷火箭燃料\n"
"到底想做什么？$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:433
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_MaxieUseFuelToEruptVolcano"
msgid ""
"MAXIE: Fufufu… Since you're so\n"
"curious, you deserve an explanation.\p"
"We're going to jettison the entire\n"
"load into MT. CHIMNEY!\p"
"With GROUDON gone, we have no need\n"
"for that slag heap of a mountain!\p"
"So we'll use the fuel's power to make\n"
"the volcano erupt!\p"
"It will be savage!$"
msgstr ""
"赤焰松：呼呼呼……既然你这么好奇，\n"
"就告诉你吧。\p"
"我们要把所有燃料\n"
"全部投进烟囱山！\p"
"固拉多已经不在了，那座像矿渣堆\n"
"一样的山对我们来说毫无用处！\p"
"所以我们要用燃料的力量\n"
"让火山喷发！\p"
"那将会是一场狂暴的喷发！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:444
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_StevenAreYouReadyToBattle"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"You're going to help me?\p"
"Let's go into battle together!\n"
"Are you ready?$"
msgstr ""
"大吾：{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"你要来帮我吗？\p"
"我们一起上吧！\n"
"准备好了吗？$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:450
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_StevenHurryGetReadyQuickly"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: Then, hurry!\n"
"Get ready quickly!$"
msgstr ""
"大吾：那就快点！\n"
"赶快做好准备！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:454
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_JustWantToExpandLand"
msgid ""
"All I want…\n"
"I just want to expand the land mass…$"
msgstr ""
"我想要的……\n"
"只是扩张陆地而已……$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:458
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_Text_TabithaDefeat"
msgid "I'm with our leader…$"
msgstr "我和首领在一起……$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:461
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_MaxieWeFailedIsAquaAlsoMisguided"
msgid ""
"MAXIE: We failed to make the volcano\n"
"erupt…\p"
"We failed to control GROUDON after\n"
"we had awoken it…\p"
"Is our goal to expand the land\n"
"misguided?\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\p"
"If…\n"
"If we, TEAM MAGMA, are wrong…\l"
"… … … … … …\p"
"Then might TEAM AQUA's goal to expand\n"
"the sea also be equally misguided?$"
msgstr ""
"赤焰松：我们没能让火山喷发……\p"
"唤醒固拉多之后，\n"
"我们也没能控制住它……\p"
"难道我们扩张陆地的目标\n"
"是错误的吗？\p"
"…… …… ……\n"
"…… …… ……\p"
"如果……\n"
"如果我们熔岩队是错的……\l"
"…… …… ……\p"
"那么，海洋队扩张大海的目标\n"
"是不是也同样是错误的呢？$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:476
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_MaxieWeWillGiveUp"
msgid ""
"MAXIE: All right…\n"
"We will give up on the fuel…\p"
"There appear to be more important\n"
"matters that I must examine…$"
msgstr ""
"赤焰松：好吧……\n"
"我们放弃燃料……\p"
"看来还有更重要的事情\n"
"需要我去仔细思考……$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F/scripts.inc:482
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_2F_Text_StevenThankYouComeSeeMeAtHome"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: Whew, that was too tense.\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, thank you.\p"
"I have something to give you as\n"
"thanks for your support.\p"
"Please come see me at home\n"
"after this.\p"
"Oh, yes, I don't live in RUSTBORO CITY.\n"
"I live right here on this island.$"
msgstr ""
"大吾：呼，刚才真是太紧张了。\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，谢谢你。\p"
"为了感谢你的帮助，\n"
"我有样东西要送给你。\p"
"等一下请到我家来找我。\p"
"哦，对了，我不住在卡那兹市。\n"
"我就住在这座岛上。$"
